\title{About this site}
\author{brentyorgey}

\import{base-macros}

\p{This site is a "forest" created using [Forester](https://www.forester-notes.org/index/). Click on headings to collapse or expand sections, or click on the alphanumeric ID next to a section heading to open the section in a new page.  Type \tt{Ctrl+K} to search the graph.  All the sources for my forest (including the build system that allows embedding [lilypond](00IO) and [diagrams](2026-W28) code; click on any music snippet or diagram to see its original source code) can be [found in this repository](https://github.com/byorgey/forest).}
